# Root-anchored on purpose: a bare `lab/` matches a directory of that name at
# ANY depth and silently excluded app/lab/, so the Defense Lab route 404d in
# production while still appearing in the nav.
#
# The Python service is deployed separately (see render.yaml); Vercel has no
# Python runtime and does not need 13MB of model artifacts in the build.
/lab/

# Design review screenshots, regenerated with `npm run capture`.
/design-baseline/

# Local verification harness — never runs in the Vercel build.
/tools/checks/

# Reference clip for the hero animation. Kept on disk, never shipped.
/this.mp4
